% Scenario: even-odd fill and clip. A five-point star is a
% self-intersecting path whose centre has winding number two; used as an
% even-odd clip and then filled even-odd, the page carries `W* n` and
% `f*`, each preceded by the path.
50 90 moveto 20 10 lineto 90 60 lineto 10 60 lineto 80 10 lineto closepath
eoclip
eofill
showpage
